<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dillon starts Selfcare.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dillon starts Selfcare.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dillon, Read said analyst Matthew Dodds and Raul Esquivel initiated coverage of Selfcare Inc with an outperform rating and a 12-to-18-month price target of $14.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 1/4 to 9-3/8.</p>
</text>
